      "body": "Add to the mixer bowl in the order listed, starting with 284 g water. Knead until smooth, bouncy and elastic, ≈8–10 min. Add water only if needed: the dough starts a bit sticky but should end soft, not sticky."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Cover in a lightly greased bowl. Rise until quite puffy (not necessarily doubled), <span class=\"rc-nw\">60–90 min</span>."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Gently deflate. Shape into a fat 9 in log and set in the greased pan."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Cover. Rise until crowned <span class=\"rc-nw\">1–1½ in</span> over the rim, <span class=\"rc-nw\">60–90 min</span>. Toward the end, preheat oven to <span class=\"rc-nw\">350 °F <span class=\"rc-muted\">(177 °C)</span></span>."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Bake 20 min. Tent loosely with foil and bake until golden and the center reads <span class=\"rc-nw\">195–200 °F</span>, <span class=\"rc-nw\">15–20 min</span> more."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Turn out onto a rack. Cool completely before wrapping."
    }
  ],
